 ### [Polar Modulo](3358-polar-modulo.md)
-Polar Modulo repeats a 2D pattern around the origin by a fixed angle determined by the number of repetitions. It applies modulo arithmetic to the angular coordinate rather than Cartesian coordinates, enabling radial symmetry. Choose it for concentric or angular sectors [G].
